claim.claim-text:
means (51) for receiving, from a core network node (9) for mobility management, Non-Access Stratum, NAS, signalling for a communication device (3);
means (57) for performing a Radio Access Network, RAN,-based paging to the communication device (3) for the NAS signalling; and
means (51) for sending, to the core network node (9) for mobility management, if the RAN-based paging fails, a UE Context Release Request message in a release procedure that is to move connection management, CM, state of the communication device (3) in the core network node (9) for mobility management to CM-IDLE, without invoking releasing a connection from another node in the core network.

receiving (S501a, S601a), from a core network node (9) for mobility management, Non-Access Stratum, NAS, signalling for a communication device (3);
performing (S503, S603) a Radio Access Network, RAN,-based paging to the communication device (3) for the NAS signalling; and
sending (S505, S605) to the core network node (9), if the RAN-based paging for the NAS signalling fails, a UE Context Release Request message in a release procedure that is to move connection management, CM, state of the communication device (3) in the core network node (9) for mobility management to CM-IDLE, without invoking releasing a connection from another node in the core network.
